Bianca: {VAR 0100 0000}, is there
anything we can do? My Munna...{VAR BE01}
Team Plasma took it...{VAR BE01}

???: I heard this lady's scream and
ran after the thief as fast as I could.{VAR BE01}
But this city is so big and so crowded...
I'm afraid I lost them.{VAR BE01}

Iris: But that's so bad!{VAR BE01}
Taking people's Pokémon is really bad!{VAR BE01}
'Cause it's really nice when
people and Pokémon are together!{VAR BE01}
They each have something the other
doesn't, and they help each other!{VAR BE01}

Having said that, finding a person or a
Pokémon here in Castelia City will be{VAR BE00}
like finding a needle in a haystack.{VAR BE01}

Team Plasma: I spy a Gym Leader?!{VAR BE01}
Last time went so well, I thought
I'd grab another Pokémon...{VAR BE00}
Rethinking...{VAR BE00}
I need to get out of here!{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Oh, Munna, I can't believe it.{VAR BE01}
Here I am, a Trainer, and I can't even
protect my own Pokémon... I'm sorry...

When someone is getting under your skin
and you want to yell at them,{VAR BE00}
scream at the ocean!{VAR BE01}
...When you're alone, of course.
